          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", 6 dc. Round 2: 2 dc in each (12 dc). Round 3: * 2 dc, 1 dc; rep (18 dc). Insert button form. Round 4: * "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dc2tog-btn"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "dc2tog"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", 1 dc; rep. Round 5: dc2tog around. Thread yarn through last 6 sts, pull tight."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
